@startuml
!include ../config/plantuml-config.iuml

title Tensor Core and Provider Relations

package "Core Tensor" as Core {
  class "Tensor<T,Rank,Device>" as TensorTRD
  class TensorView
  class TensorDescriptor
  enum OpStatus
}

package "Runtime Context" as Ctx {
  class CleanTensorOpContext
  interface IOpProvider
  class ProviderRegistry
  class BuildCaps
}

package "Providers" as Prov {
  class DefaultProvider
  class CuBLASProvider
  class CuDNNProvider
  class RocBLASProvider
  class MIOpenProvider
}

package "Ops Front-Ends" as Ops {
  class Conv2D
  class Gemm
  class Activations
  class BatchNorm
  class InferenceOps
  class HighLevel
  class Layer
}

TensorView --> TensorTRD : view of
TensorDescriptor --> TensorTRD : describes

CleanTensorOpContext --> IOpProvider : holds/returns
ProviderRegistry --> IOpProvider : constructs/selects
BuildCaps --> ProviderRegistry : build flags

IOpProvider <|.. DefaultProvider
IOpProvider <|.. CuBLASProvider
IOpProvider <|.. CuDNNProvider
IOpProvider <|.. RocBLASProvider
IOpProvider <|.. MIOpenProvider

Ops ..> TensorTRD : operates on
Ops ..> CleanTensorOpContext : optional vendor path
Ops ..> OpStatus : status paths
BatchNorm ..> CleanTensorOpContext

legend right
<b>Legend</b>
----
Solid: inheritance / composition
Dashed: usage/dependency
endlegend

@enduml
